{include "pages/partials/error-page.disyl" with {
    status_code: status_code|default:500,
    page_title:  page_title|default:''
}}
{* 500 — Internal Server Error.
   Renders the shared kernel error card (also used by the kernel exception
   handler for 401/403 when status_code is supplied). Callers must never pass
   exception text or stack traces here — only safe copy, and detail stays
   gated behind show_detail which 500 surfaces never enable. *}
